// about, from MEME's own archive; their alt names what the photo is rather
// than disclaiming what it isn't. `pitch-quorum` and `sound-workshop` carry no
// photo at all (kit-geometric), and their alt now says THAT honestly — the
// prior text wrongly described a "background photo" on cards that have none.
const PROGRAMS = [
